00:11:48,980 --> 00:11:49,980
I've never heard of an OC.

274
00:11:49,980 --> 00:11:50,980
That's so unique!

275
00:11:50,980 --> 00:11:51,980
You like to do this?

276
00:11:51,980 --> 00:11:52,980
Yeah!

277
00:11:52,980 --> 00:11:54,980
I've never heard of an OC.

278
00:11:54,980 --> 00:11:55,980
That's so unique!

279
00:11:55,980 --> 00:11:58,280
You like traditional designs?

280
00:11:58,280 --> 00:12:01,280
Yeah, and stuff that's usually catered toward men.

281
00:12:01,280 --> 00:12:02,280
How neat!

282
00:12:02,280 --> 00:12:04,280
I appreciate the praise, but calm down.

283
00:12:04,280 --> 00:12:07,280
My cosplay isn't particularly unique or impressive.

284
00:12:07,280 --> 00:12:11,280
I like traditional Japanese art and patterns,

285
00:12:11,280 --> 00:12:13,280
and I'm into swords.

286
00:12:13,280 --> 00:12:15,280
It's practically been done to death.

287
00:12:15,280 --> 00:12:17,280
It's not really that creative.

288
00:12:17,280 --> 00:12:18,580
What?!

289
00:12:26,580 --> 00:12:27,580
What's up?

290
00:12:27,580 --> 00:12:29,580
I'm sorry.

291
00:12:29,580 --> 00:12:32,580
It was rude of me to raise my voice at you like that.

292
00:12:32,580 --> 00:12:33,580
It's fine.

293
00:12:33,580 --> 00:12:34,880
Fine!

294
00:12:34,880 --> 00:12:35,880
What you're saying might be true,

295
00:12:35,880 --> 00:12:37,880
but that doesn't make your art any less impressive!

296
00:12:37,880 --> 00:12:39,880
That's why I reached out to you!

297
00:12:39,880 --> 00:12:41,880
To me, it's no less than perfect!

298
00:12:41,880 --> 00:12:44,880
When I said what you're saying might be true,

299
00:12:44,880 --> 00:12:47,880
I meant in the way that I don't really know what I'm talking about,

300
00:12:47,880 --> 00:12:48,880
so I defer to your expertise.

301
00:12:48,880 --> 00:12:50,880
I wasn't trying to double down on your criticism.

302
00:12:50,880 --> 00:13:04,180
It's okay.

303
00:13:04,180 --> 00:13:05,180
Yeah, I get that.

304
00:13:05,180 --> 00:13:06,180
Thank you.

305
00:13:06,180 --> 00:13:07,180
Sure, of course.

306
00:13:07,180 --> 00:13:10,180
So you want to learn about prop-making, don't you?

307
00:13:10,180 --> 00:13:13,180
Let's get to it, then.

308
00:13:13,180 --> 00:13:14,880
I'm very thankful.

309
00:13:14,880 --> 00:13:18,180
To start, there are a few comments I didn't send.

310
00:13:18,180 --> 00:13:19,180
You have more?

311
00:13:19,180 --> 00:13:20,180
Uh-huh.

312
00:13:20,180 --> 00:13:21,480
You sent so many.

313
00:13:21,480 --> 00:13:23,480
That's a crazy word count.

314
00:13:23,480 --> 00:13:26,480
But I'm here because I was impressed by your attention to detail,

315
00:13:26,480 --> 00:13:28,480
so I suppose I should have expected this.

316
00:13:28,480 --> 00:13:30,180
That was half of what I wrote!

317
00:13:30,180 --> 00:13:31,680
Just wait!

318
00:13:31,680 --> 00:13:32,880
Like I was saying before,

319
00:13:32,880 --> 00:13:35,480
the detail you captured in the blade was seriously un-

320
00:13:39,480 --> 00:13:40,480
It's fine.

321
00:13:40,480 --> 00:13:42,180
Um, so sorry.

322
00:13:44,180 --> 00:13:45,180
It's Gojo.

323
00:13:45,180 --> 00:13:46,080
I'm aware.

324
00:13:46,080 --> 00:13:47,180
Where you at?

325
00:13:47,180 --> 00:13:49,880
I'm on the same bench where we chatted with Himeno.

326
00:13:49,880 --> 00:13:50,580
Nice.

327
00:13:50,580 --> 00:13:51,180
We're close.

328
00:13:51,180 --> 00:13:53,180
Can Suzuka and I swing by?

329
00:13:53,180 --> 00:13:54,680
Uh, give me just a moment.

330
00:13:55,880 --> 00:13:59,180
Hey, so, I actually came by here with a friend today.

331
00:13:59,180 --> 00:14:00,180
And they want to meet up?

332
00:14:00,180 --> 00:14:01,180
That's fine.

333
00:14:01,180 --> 00:14:03,180
Oh, thank you so much!

334
00:14:03,180 --> 00:14:04,180
Come on by!

335
00:14:04,180 --> 00:14:05,480
Will do.

336
00:14:05,480 --> 00:14:06,480
I already found you.

337
00:14:06,480 --> 00:14:07,480
Ha-ha!

338
00:14:07,480 --> 00:14:08,480
I'm over here!

339
00:14:08,480 --> 00:14:10,480
Hiya, Goober!

340
00:14:10,480 --> 00:14:11,480
Look up!

341
00:14:11,480 --> 00:14:12,780
Look up!

342
00:14:17,780 --> 00:14:19,780
See me now?

343
00:14:19,780 --> 00:14:21,780
Hey!

344
00:14:25,780 --> 00:14:27,780
I've got some super fun news!

345
00:14:27,780 --> 00:14:29,280
Get ready, get ready!

346
00:14:29,280 --> 00:14:30,280
You ready?

347
00:14:30,280 --> 00:14:32,780
Suzuka's sexy friends invited me to their after party,

348
00:14:32,780 --> 00:14:34,780
and even told me I could bring a buddy!

349
00:14:34,780 --> 00:14:36,080
A party?

350
00:14:36,080 --> 00:14:37,080
Uh-huh!

351
00:14:37,080 --> 00:14:39,580
Apparently they threw shindigs after all these events.

352
00:14:39,580 --> 00:14:40,580
Fun!

353
00:14:41,580 --> 00:14:42,580
Huh?

354
00:14:42,580 --> 00:14:45,580
Oh, hey, I forgot to introduce you to Kitagawa.

355
00:14:45,580 --> 00:14:47,580
This is Akira.

356
00:14:47,580 --> 00:14:48,580
You're Akira?

357
00:14:50,080 --> 00:14:51,580
Hey down there!

358
00:14:51,580 --> 00:14:52,780
How goes it?

359
00:14:52,780 --> 00:14:54,080
My name's Maureen.

360
00:14:56,080 --> 00:14:58,080
Uh, hello?

361
00:14:58,080 --> 00:14:58,580
What the?

362
00:14:58,580 --> 00:14:59,880
Aki?!

363
00:14:59,880 --> 00:15:01,380
Oh, hey, girly pop!

364
00:15:01,380 --> 00:15:04,880
Wait, is this the prop maker friend you were telling me about?

365
00:15:04,880 --> 00:15:07,380
That's like a level 10 crazy coincidence!

366
00:15:07,380 --> 00:15:08,880
Yeah!

367
00:15:08,880 --> 00:15:09,880
This is him.

368
00:15:09,880 --> 00:15:10,880
Meet Gojo.

369
00:15:10,880 --> 00:15:11,880
Huh?

370
00:15:11,880 --> 00:15:12,880
It's nice to meet you.

371
00:15:12,880 --> 00:15:14,380
I'm Wakana Gojo.

372
00:15:14,380 --> 00:15:15,380
You are?

373
00:15:16,380 --> 00:15:18,380
I think of Wakana as a woman's name,

374
00:15:18,380 --> 00:15:20,380
so I totally thought he was a girl.

375
00:15:20,380 --> 00:15:22,880
I see now I was mistaken.

376
00:15:22,880 --> 00:15:25,880
He's Akira's fan and Maureen's friend.

377
00:15:25,880 --> 00:15:28,680
That can only mean one thing.

378
00:15:29,680 --> 00:15:32,680
I've spotted a real-life high school boy in the wild!

379
00:15:33,480 --> 00:15:35,180
Goo goo gaga, baby!

380
00:15:35,180 --> 00:15:37,180
I'm Maureen's mature lady friend!

381
00:15:38,380 --> 00:15:39,680
Huh?

382
00:15:39,680 --> 00:15:41,180
That wasn't normal!

383
00:15:41,180 --> 00:15:43,680
I wonder if Amine and Miyako have wrapped up yet?

384
00:15:43,680 --> 00:15:45,680
I've never been to an after-party before,

385
00:15:45,680 --> 00:15:47,080
so I'm mega hyped!

386
00:15:47,080 --> 00:15:47,880
So am I!

387
00:15:49,380 --> 00:15:49,880
Mia!

388
00:15:49,880 --> 00:15:50,680
Emergency!

389
00:15:51,180 --> 00:15:52,680
This after-party is risky!

390
00:15:53,380 --> 00:15:54,680
Aki and Maureen!

391
00:15:54,680 --> 00:15:55,680
This is bad!

392
00:15:55,880 --> 00:15:56,680
Aki and Maureen!

393
00:15:59,680 --> 00:16:02,180
I loved the look,

394
00:16:02,180 --> 00:16:04,180
but I feel so much better without all the tape!

395
00:16:05,980 --> 00:16:08,980
Do you always hold mini-parties after cosplay events?

396
00:16:12,480 --> 00:16:13,280
Always?

397
00:16:15,480 --> 00:16:17,080
Let's learn about cosplay!

398
00:16:18,380 --> 00:16:20,180
Hi, it's Aoi again!

399
00:16:20,180 --> 00:16:23,180
Have you ever been to a party after a cosplay event?

400
00:16:23,180 --> 00:16:25,480
They're one of my favorite parts of the day!

401
00:16:25,480 --> 00:16:28,480
You see, though events are fun, they can be stressful.

402
00:16:28,480 --> 00:16:31,480
There's so much to look at and so many pictures to pose for,

403
00:16:31,480 --> 00:16:33,480
you might not have time to talk to your friends!

404
00:16:33,480 --> 00:16:35,780
That's why it's best to go somewhere you can chat,

405
00:16:35,780 --> 00:16:38,780
like a karaoke room, restaurant, or collab cafe!

406
00:16:39,480 --> 00:16:42,080
Whenever we get really sweaty, we celebrate at the spa!

407
00:16:42,080 --> 00:16:43,080
How fancy!

408
00:16:43,080 --> 00:16:44,080
The spa?

409
00:16:44,080 --> 00:16:49,380
I have to show you Miyako's epic rindo cute!

410
00:16:49,380 --> 00:16:50,380
I'd love to see it!

411
00:16:50,380 --> 00:16:51,380
Ta-da!

412
00:16:53,380 --> 00:16:54,380
What an awesome shot!

413
00:16:54,380 --> 00:16:55,380
I got a better one!

414
00:16:55,380 --> 00:16:56,380
Check it!

415
00:16:56,380 --> 00:16:59,380
Suzuka shared all her photographer magic with me!

416
00:16:59,380 --> 00:17:01,380
She looks completely different there!

417
00:17:01,380 --> 00:17:02,680
I know!

418
00:17:02,680 --> 00:17:03,680
Insane, right?

419
00:17:03,680 --> 00:17:04,680
Absolutely!

420
00:17:04,680 --> 00:17:06,680
I didn't realize adjusting the angle could do so much!

421
00:17:06,680 --> 00:17:07,680
Sounds good!

422
00:17:07,680 --> 00:17:08,680
Let's pick a few more things to share!

423
00:17:08,680 --> 00:17:10,680
Let's play with that next photo shoot!

424
00:17:10,680 --> 00:17:11,680
Yeah, for sure!

425
00:17:11,680 --> 00:17:13,680
Dang, that was speedy!

426
00:17:13,680 --> 00:17:15,680
How pretty!

427
00:17:16,680 --> 00:17:19,680
Akira, could you grab my bag?

428
00:17:20,680 --> 00:17:21,680
Here.

429
00:17:21,680 --> 00:17:22,680
Thank you!

430
00:17:22,680 --> 00:17:23,980
Huh?

431
00:17:23,980 --> 00:17:24,980
Huh?

432
00:17:28,980 --> 00:17:31,980
Your baby rindo knew he is so cute and squishy!

433
00:17:31,980 --> 00:17:34,980
I thought he could really amplify my pancake pic!

434
00:17:38,980 --> 00:17:41,980
So adults walk around with dolls too?

435
00:17:41,980 --> 00:17:42,980
Not a thought!

436
00:17:42,980 --> 00:17:44,980
And she's talking to it!

437
00:17:44,980 --> 00:17:47,980
I'm planning to sew you a beautiful new outfit today!

438
00:17:47,980 --> 00:17:50,980
And then tomorrow, it'll finally be ready for you to try on!

439
00:17:50,980 --> 00:17:55,280
So it's not just me!

440
00:17:55,280 --> 00:17:58,280
I'm obsessed with its tiny costume!

441
00:17:58,280 --> 00:18:00,280
I decorated my Xi'an Nui too!

442
00:18:00,280 --> 00:18:01,280
Yeah!

443
00:18:01,280 --> 00:18:03,280
I think you posted a pic of it!

444
00:18:03,280 --> 00:18:05,280
The outfit is one of my favorites!

445
00:18:05,280 --> 00:18:07,780
Then why are you gripping the poor thing like a baseball?

446
00:18:07,780 --> 00:18:11,280
I used to keep her on my bag, but I suck at taking care of my stuff.

447
00:18:11,280 --> 00:18:15,280
Now my Nui sit by my TV at home, so they can't get all nasty.

448
00:18:15,280 --> 00:18:17,780
You bring your dolls with you sometimes too, right?

449
00:18:17,780 --> 00:18:19,780
It would be a crime not to!

450
00:18:19,780 --> 00:18:21,580
Agreed!

451
00:18:21,580 --> 00:18:24,080
It's always nice to have a version of your fave!

452
00:18:24,080 --> 00:18:26,080
And you feel like you're about to kill someone at work.

453
00:18:26,080 --> 00:18:28,080
Seeing it brings you peace of mind!

454
00:18:28,080 --> 00:18:29,080
Yeah!

455
00:18:29,080 --> 00:18:31,080
I don't think Ojo caught that.

456
00:18:35,080 --> 00:18:37,080
Oh, he's not gonna make it either.

457
00:18:37,080 --> 00:18:38,080
That's too bad.

458
00:18:38,080 --> 00:18:43,380
Is everything okay?

459
00:18:43,380 --> 00:18:46,380
We had a fun group cosplay planned out for next Sunday.

460
00:18:46,380 --> 00:18:50,380
But all the other cosplayers had to drop out because they're needed at their jobs.

461
00:18:50,380 --> 00:18:53,380
It would be such a bummer not to get weekends off.

462
00:18:53,380 --> 00:18:57,180
We already reserved the studio, so maybe just the three of us should go.

463
00:18:57,180 --> 00:18:58,680
It's better than nothing.

464
00:18:58,680 --> 00:19:00,480
What are you guys cosplaying?

465
00:19:00,480 --> 00:19:01,480
Played Coffin?

466
00:19:01,480 --> 00:19:02,980
We're doing that.

467
00:19:02,980 --> 00:19:03,980
Coffin?

468
00:19:03,980 --> 00:19:05,480
I'm obsessed with it right now.

469
00:19:05,480 --> 00:19:06,980
It's so frickin' awesome!

470
00:19:06,980 --> 00:19:07,980
I'll need those pics!

471
00:19:07,980 --> 00:19:08,980
Uh...

472
00:19:08,980 --> 00:19:09,480
Huh?

473
00:19:09,480 --> 00:19:10,480
What's Coffin?

474
00:19:10,480 --> 00:19:11,980
A horror game!

475
00:19:11,980 --> 00:19:16,480
It's about these cute nuns who live together and slowly get killed off one by one.

476
00:19:16,480 --> 00:19:18,980
The goal of the game is to figure out who killed them.

477
00:19:18,980 --> 00:19:20,980
So it's a mystery game.

478
00:19:20,980 --> 00:19:25,780
There's Sister Mira, Sister Rose, Sister Char, Sister Emma, Sister Claire, and Sister Soph.

479
00:19:25,780 --> 00:19:27,780
You're still looking for people, right?

480
00:19:28,780 --> 00:19:30,780
So, uh, may I join your group?

481
00:19:30,780 --> 00:19:31,780
You want to?

482
00:19:31,780 --> 00:19:35,280
A habit would hide my physique and I'm a really big fan of the game.

483
00:19:35,280 --> 00:19:37,280
You're the best ever!

484
00:19:37,280 --> 00:19:39,780
I'm begging you to let me give you money!

485
00:19:39,780 --> 00:19:40,780
Thank you!

486
00:19:40,780 --> 00:19:42,280
You're saving our lives!

487
00:19:42,280 --> 00:19:44,280
I'm just happy that you're letting me join!

488
00:19:44,280 --> 00:19:45,780
Did you make the outfits?

489
00:19:45,780 --> 00:19:47,780
Nope, they're pre-made.

490
00:19:47,780 --> 00:19:48,780
They sell them at ACOS.

491
00:19:48,780 --> 00:19:51,580
So they'll probably have the character wigs, too.

492
00:19:51,580 --> 00:19:52,580
I'll buy one today.

493
00:19:52,580 --> 00:19:53,580
Oh!

494
00:19:53,580 --> 00:19:54,580
They're cheap?

495
00:19:54,580 --> 00:19:55,580
Today?

496
00:19:55,580 --> 00:19:56,580
So proactive!

497
00:20:00,580 --> 00:20:02,580
Now you only need three more people.

498
00:20:02,580 --> 00:20:04,580
You should join, Maureen.

499
00:20:10,580 --> 00:20:12,580
You are a Coffin fan, right?

500
00:20:12,580 --> 00:20:13,580
I am, but...

501
00:20:13,580 --> 00:20:15,580
You have to do it!

502
00:20:15,580 --> 00:20:18,580
I was just thinking about how I want to cosplay with you again.

503
00:20:18,580 --> 00:20:20,380
Would that be okay?

504
00:20:20,380 --> 00:20:23,380
That would be great, as long as Maureen doesn't mind!

505
00:20:23,380 --> 00:20:24,380
Yeah!

506
00:20:24,380 --> 00:20:26,380
If you're free, you should do it!

507
00:20:26,380 --> 00:20:28,380
Well, I would.

508
00:20:28,380 --> 00:20:29,380
But, uh...

509
00:20:29,380 --> 00:20:32,380
I'm actually on a diet at the moment.

510
00:20:32,380 --> 00:20:35,380
I can't do any new cosplays right now.

511
00:20:35,380 --> 00:20:38,380
Ah, that explains your unsweet tea and the salad.

512
00:20:38,380 --> 00:20:42,380
Also, that's a real quick turnaround.

513
00:20:42,380 --> 00:20:44,380
Nah, we couldn't get it ready in time.

514
00:20:44,380 --> 00:20:47,180
Then you should buy a pre-made costume like the rest of us.

515
00:20:47,180 --> 00:20:48,180
Oh...

516
00:20:48,180 --> 00:20:52,180
Since we're a group, the matching outfits will look cohesive.

517
00:20:52,180 --> 00:20:54,180
We would love to have you if you're willing to join us.

518
00:20:54,180 --> 00:20:55,980
Hmm?

519
00:20:59,980 --> 00:21:00,980
Sounds like a good plan.

520
00:21:03,980 --> 00:21:04,980
I'm so down!

521
00:21:04,980 --> 00:21:07,980
Your girl Maureen is putting the inn in Coffin!

522
00:21:07,980 --> 00:21:08,980
We really appreciate it!

523
00:21:08,980 --> 00:21:10,980
This is gonna be gnarly!

524
00:21:10,980 --> 00:21:11,980
What a huge win!

525
00:21:11,980 --> 00:21:13,980
Just two members away from the full party!

526
00:21:13,980 --> 00:21:15,980
This rocks!

527
00:21:15,980 --> 00:21:17,980
I love group cosplays!

528
00:21:17,980 --> 00:21:19,780
Oh, I know!

529
00:21:19,780 --> 00:21:20,780
Question!

530
00:21:20,780 --> 00:21:21,780
Hmm?

531
00:21:21,780 --> 00:21:23,780
Is it cool if I invite somebody, too?

532
00:21:23,780 --> 00:21:24,780
Of course it is!

533
00:21:24,780 --> 00:21:25,780
You're the best!

534
00:21:25,780 --> 00:21:27,780
I'll call her later!

535
00:21:27,780 --> 00:21:28,780
It's fine, just call her now!

536
00:21:28,780 --> 00:21:30,780
Well, if you insist...

537
00:21:33,780 --> 00:21:35,780
She's calling someone.

538
00:21:35,780 --> 00:21:36,780
Who could it be?

539
00:21:38,780 --> 00:21:39,780
Is it really?

540
00:21:39,780 --> 00:21:41,780
Is it someone scary?

541
00:21:41,780 --> 00:21:43,780
No, that's not it.

542
00:21:43,780 --> 00:21:47,580
She's just a very particular person.

543
00:21:47,580 --> 00:21:49,580
Getting her to agree could be a challenge.

544
00:21:56,580 --> 00:21:57,580
It's Maureen!

545
00:21:58,580 --> 00:21:59,580
Hey, Juju!

546
00:22:01,580 --> 00:22:02,580
Whoa, whoa, whoa!

547
00:22:02,580 --> 00:22:03,580
What do you want?

548
00:22:06,580 --> 00:22:07,580
Kawaii, kaiwaii!

549
00:22:09,580 --> 00:22:11,580
Kawaii, kaiwaii!

550
00:22:13,780 --> 00:22:15,580
